e value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. November to December came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, January to February and August to September each came in at 33% of normal. Grids 23867 and 23868 had their driest year in 2025, at 69% of normal.</p>"}
